{"screen_name": "sogenshinkan", "file": "sogenshinkan-8ad4ab", "name": "そーげんしんかんへい", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1754158027257614336/kK7WeQte.jpg", "header_url": null, "description": "お絵描きします。\n\nSkeb⇒http://skeb.jp/@sogenshinkan", "total_works": 16, "scraped_works": 16, "first_seen": "2026-03-20T17:26:46.929317+00:00", "last_updated": "2026-03-20T17:26:46.929317+00:00", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 14000, "recorded_at": "2026-03-20T17:26:46.929317+00:00"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 14000}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 14000, "max": 14000}}, "links": [{"label": "Twitter", "url": "https://x.com/sogenshinkan", "name": "sogenshinkan"}, {"label": "Pixiv", "url": "https://www.pixiv.net/users/17559813", "name": "17559813"}], "flags": {}, "acceptable": false, "works": [{"path": "/@sogenshinkan/works/16", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/5acaa408/uploads/origins/3597fc2b-1b8d-4c3c-bd2a-2efbe7e6586b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c5386705db818ef58a81b9f722adbac6", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5acaa408/uploads/origins/3597fc2b-1b8d-4c3c-bd2a-2efbe7e6586b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c5386705db818ef58a81b9f722adbac6, https://si.imgix.net/5acaa408/uploads/origins/3597fc2b-1b8d-4c3c-bd2a-2efbe7e6586b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1f96c6f3e994111eeef1b166c043c9e8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5acaa408/uploads/origins/3597fc2b-1b8d-4c3c-bd2a-2efbe7e6586b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2eea9427f6198faf7523f27c4eb5cc01 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "Hello I hope you are doing fine!\n\nI would like you to draw スズラン from アークナイツ again!\n\nThis time I want you draw her in a rainy day with her wet see through clothes taking shelter from the rain. I want her bra to be visible through her clothes due to how wet she is. スズラン is wringing out her skirt to remove the water while smiling.\n\nYou can use this as a reference for the picture.(https://www.pixiv.net/en/artworks/116559365)\n\nMost importantly i want the picture to be from a very low angle where you can see her panties that are under her white tights.\n\nBe sure to have her in her normal clothes!\n\n\nThank you for your consideration!!!\n\n\nこんにちは、お元気でいることを願っています！\n\nまたアークナイツのスズランを描いて欲しいです！\n\n今回は雨の日に濡れて透けた服を着て雨宿りしている姿を描いていただきたいです。濡れすぎて服の上からブラジャーが見えてしまいそうです。 スズランは微笑みながらスカートを絞って水を払っている。\n\n絵の参考にしていただけます(https://www.pixiv.net/ja/artworks/116559365)\n\n最も重要なことは、白いタイツの下にある彼女のパンティーが見える非常に低い角度からの写真であることです。\n\nぜひ普段着でいらしてくださいね！\n\nご検討をお願いいたします！！！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@sogenshinkan/works/15", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/256e8dd0/uploads/origins/32401fef-bb31-4ae0-89fe-9223cffb3bcc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=21f923f2b8a3411c4ab140f767eaf145", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/256e8dd0/uploads/origins/32401fef-bb31-4ae0-89fe-9223cffb3bcc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=21f923f2b8a3411c4ab140f767eaf145, https://si.imgix.net/256e8dd0/uploads/origins/32401fef-bb31-4ae0-89fe-9223cffb3bcc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1469f2a8cd272a4e18c4b824278497f9 2x, https://si.imgix.net/256e8dd0/uploads/origins/32401fef-bb31-4ae0-89fe-9223cffb3bcc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ea0ae626f0e1ecc71268e871d34f4498 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! As you can see I am a big fan of your work!\n\nI would like you to draw “Firefly” from “Collapse: Star Rail” in a dark forest, lit by fireflies. I want you to draw her looking at the sky from a relatively low angle (see “https://pbs.twimg.com/media/GOYk-jEa4AAbH95?format=jpg&name=small” for reference).\n\n暗い森の中で、ホタルに照らされた「崩壊：スターレイル」の「ホタル」を描いてほしい。比較的低いアングルから空を見ている彼女を描いてほしい（参考までに 「https://pbs.twimg.com/media/GOYk-jEa4AAbH95?format=jpg&name=small」）。\n\nThank you so much for your attention!\n\nhttps://x.com/nyanya_/status/1788476065809404270", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@sogenshinkan/works/14", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/bd99fc93/uploads/origins/e615f74c-d489-4bc2-883b-355d1598d44c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f76d132dea534a82d80bd7c5bcf31d63", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bd99fc93/uploads/origins/e615f74c-d489-4bc2-883b-355d1598d44c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f76d132dea534a82d80bd7c5bcf31d63, https://si.imgix.net/bd99fc93/uploads/origins/e615f74c-d489-4bc2-883b-355d1598d44c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b034072e76fe7a490c2cea50de0138ce 2x, https://si.imgix.net/bd99fc93/uploads/origins/e615f74c-d489-4bc2-883b-355d1598d44c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1fed59f6f44ebcb25f6ee921d9632d35 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！あなたの絵がとても好きです！FEエンゲージのヴェイルを描いてほしいです！（できればローアングルで）お願いします！ありがとうございます!!!\n\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/840787497004957757/1224228601298157568/Veyre0.png?ex=661cbabb&is=660a45bb&hm=b1b06d2faf7187b24f202532459af1a5642af421f25d3896cf4ee8e20a72a66e&", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@sogenshinkan/works/13", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/5f696863/uploads/origins/85a80a16-a9e4-4cb3-b163-8efce105a416?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0e649e62d8231fb619017d35d8b22961", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5f696863/uploads/origins/85a80a16-a9e4-4cb3-b163-8efce105a416?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0e649e62d8231fb619017d35d8b22961, https://si.imgix.net/5f696863/uploads/origins/85a80a16-a9e4-4cb3-b163-8efce105a416?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&